The tune is to lower the castle drawbridge, although it appears that
you haven't hit that level yet (it's down in the dungeons below
Medusa). You play the tune on an instrument (flute, harp, etc.),
though I usually find another way of getting in.

To find the secret doors at the bottom of the Mines:  go to the up
staircase, go S 4 paces, go W until you run into a wall, and search.
When you find the secret door, go in and W until you run into a wall,
search again and you will find another secret door.  Open this second
door and you will find a luckstone and some gems. 
